abstract: "Software and archived data supporting two related outputs: a 20-run 3-qubit GHZ hardware probe (multi-agent-to-QPU organisational framing) and a later six-block ibm_fez QAOA decision study on six synthetic six-variable fixtures. Not a quantum-advantage claim. Cite the repository commit; no GitHub Release or DOI existed when this file was updated."
